      "blocks": {
        "item0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ultrasonic teeth cleaning £50",
            "text": "<p>A gentle, effective way to deep clean your dog’s teeth. we use a non-vibrating 'ultrasonic' toothbrush (to reduce stress) and microbubble toothpaste to tackle plaque, tartar, and bad breath. Groomers gently scrape buildup and assess your dog’s dental health in a pre-treatment consultation. Multiple sessions may be needed based on severity. No sedation is used, if a dog is too fidgety, we pause treatment and inform the owner. Sessions take about 30 minutes and can be added to grooming or booked separately.</p>",
            "image": "",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#546EB2",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Regular Teeth Cleaning £16",
            "text": "<p>A great way to maintain your dog's oral health. We use a regular, soft toothbrush with a special dog toothpaste to brush their teeth. This service is perfect for puppies as an introduction to teeth cleaning, or if your dog's teeth doesn't need a deeper cleaning, only maintenance. Regular Teeth Cleaning can not be booked as a standalone session, only as an addition to any of our grooming services. Please keep in mind that, similarly to our Ultrasonic service, if a dog doesn't let us complete the session, we don't force the treatment on them and the owner will be notified.</p>",
            "image": "",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#546EB2",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ultrasonic Teeth Cleaning Package 3x Sessions £130",
            "text": "<p>Our Ultrasonic Teeth Cleaning Package contains 3x sessions in one package, which is a great way to save if you know your dog will have this treatment on a regular basis.</p>",
            "image": "",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#546EB2",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Nail Trim £19",
            "text": "<p>Our Nail Trim service is a great way to keep your dog's nails trimmed back to a healthy length without the need of booking a grooming appointment. It takes around 5-10 minutes, can be booked via phone or as a walk-in service, however, it is always recommended to call up ahead and check the time so we can make sure there's a groomer available for you.</p>",
            "image": "",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#546EB2",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Blueberry Facial £19",
            "text": "<p>Helps reduce tear stains and mouth area discoloration in white or light-coated dogs. It uses a special shampoo, gently massaged and thoroughly rinsed for a clean, brighter coat. Multiple sessions and ongoing care may be needed for severe staining. Available only with wash &amp; fluff, wash &amp; tidy, or full groom appointments, not as a standalone service</p>",
            "image": "",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#546EB2",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ear Cleaning £16",
            "text": "<p>Keeping your dog's ears cleaned regularly. While it's included in all of our grooming services, if you find your pup having dirty ears after a long session in the park, and you would like to make sure their ears are cleaned perfectly, we can book them in for a quick treatment. It takes around 5-10 minutes, can be booked via phone or as a walk-in service, however, it is always recommended to call up ahead and check the time so we can make sure there's a groomer available for you.</p>",
            "image": "",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#546EB2",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Paw & Nose Balm £9",
            "text": "<p>Add our Paw &amp; Nose Balm treatment to your dog’s groom for extra protection and moisture. Ideal for hot summers or cold winters, it shields sensitive skin from harsh weather. Made with natural oils, it's safe for all breeds, even if licked.</p>",
            "image": "",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#546EB2",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item7": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tick Removal £10",
            "text": "<p>Our Tick Removal service is perfect if you can't go to the vet, but your pup has an unwanted hijacker. Our groomers are trained to remove ticks safely, without risking any complications. It takes around 5-10 minutes, can be booked via phone or as a walk-in service, however, it is always recommended to call up ahead and check the time so we can make sure there's a groomer available for you.</p>",
            "image": "",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#546EB2",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Dematting Charges between £20 to £50",
            "text": "<p>Dematting is an add-on to grooming for dogs with matted patches. The groomer will assess the coat during the pre-grooming consultation and advise if extra treatment is needed. Pricing depends on matting severity. It adds 20–30 minutes to the session. If matting is extreme or causes stress, a short cut may be recommended for the dog’s wellbeing. This service cannot be booked on its own.</p>",
            "image": "",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#546EB2",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item9": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Seasonal Packages £40",
            "text": "<p>Our Seasonal Packages are a great way to give your pup an extra pamper during their groom. It includes Regular Teeth Cleaning, Blueberry Facial, Paw &amp; Nose Balm, a Doggy Biscuit from our Townhouse Cafe, a little Seasonal Bow and a pump or two of a dog friendly perfume. Seasonal Packages can be asked on top of a grooming service and can not be booked as a standalone service.</p>",
            "image": "",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#546EB2",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
