          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Canine Oral Health at Love My Human",
            "text": "<p>We all understand the vital role oral health plays in our overall well-being, and the same holds true for our beloved dogs. Keeping your dog’s teeth and gums clean is essential not only for their breath but also for their overall health. Healthy, clean canine teeth contribute to a longer, happier life, preventing issues such as gum disease, tooth decay, and potential organ&nbsp;infections.</p>",
            "image": "",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#546EB2",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "At Love My Human, we offer a professional canine teeth cleaning service that doesn’t require anaesthesia.",
            "text": "<p>Using an advanced ultrasonic cleaning method, we can gently and effectively remove plaque, tartar, and bacteria from your dog’s teeth. This method works especially well on young, healthy teeth without enamel cracks or major damage.</p>",
            "image": "",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#546EB2",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
