      "blocks": {
        "item0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Xena Neysha",
            "text": "<p>I booked a<strong> grooming session</strong> for my Pomeranian Neysha today, and the service was absolutely amazing! The results were nothing short of spectacular. The lady who took care of my dog was incredibly meticulous and thorough. She asked me a lot of questions and even requested pictures to make sure she fully understood what I wanted. She also took extra care to ensure that the grooming wouldn’t damage the quality of my Pomeranian’s fur. I was genuinely impressed by her dedication and commitment to excellence and Neysha didn’t want to leave afterwards. The results were flawless, and I couldn’t be happier! I’m so glad I found this place, and I highly recommend it to anyone who hasn’t tried it yet, definitely worth it!</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/5stars.png",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#546EB2",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Mariam El-Banna",
            "text": "<p>Took my kitten for his first-ever groom to introduce him to the whole process. The ladies were lovely and incredibly understanding, knowing this was his first time. They agreed they would only take him as far as he was comfortable, and since he has such a lovely and pleasant disposition, I was a bit worried that a negative experience might shake him.</p><p>However, all concerns were put to rest when I came to collect him. They showed me photos and little videos — he did so well! And when I brought him home, he was just as confident, friendly, and relaxed as ever.</p><p>Super happy with the service, and I’ll definitely be bringing him back for his regular grooming.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/5stars.png",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#546EB2",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Aphria O’Brien",
            "text": "<p>Simply love this place! The staff are absolutely fabulous—friendly, caring, and so good with Jules. He loves going there to spend the afternoon mingling with his friends. They’re incredibly accommodating too; whenever I need an emergency appointment, it’s never a hassle. Truly grateful for their kindness and professionalism.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/5stars.png",
